    Write the general developer glossary (#8095)
    
    Replaces the stub with short definitions of terms that recur across
    multiple architecture pages and are easy to conflate (Asset vs. Snapshot
    vs. Episode vs. Event vs. Media Package, Working File Repository vs.
    Workspace, Job/Service/Load), each linking to the page where the concept
    is covered in full. Deliberately leaves out terms already scoped to a
    single topic with their own local glossary, such as the External API's
    or OAI-PMH's.
    
